# AEP release string allow list
# Release string: 2.9.0
# Policy: VERSION-286-P0. One product release string describes this tree.
# Every entry below is a stale release string that remains on purpose, because it is
# historical or because it pins a third party package.
# Format: repository path, one tab, the exact line that remains, one tab, the reason.
# Tool: AEP-User-Experience/harness/check-release-strings.mjs
#

README.md	## What is new in 2.8 compared to 2.75 (from May 2026)	a heading that compares this release with the 2.75 release
